 as the final line, with no prose:\n\n{\"summary\":\"\",\"comments\":[{\"severity\":\"<high|medium|low>\",\"confidence\":<0-1>,\"body\":\"<concise 1-3 sentence comment>\",\"location\":{\"granularity\":\"line\",\"file_path\":\"<file path>\",\"start_line\":<final right-side line number>}}]}\n\nIf there are no actionable findings, return: {\"summary\":\"\",\"comments\":[]}"
